:: 8/24/2026 MVP

MVP goal is get game to a state with minimal mechanics so you can start designing puzzles

-fix state issue in level editor
-think through state/movement logic ordering (see how other games do it)
    -in particular, you will have lasers destroying blocks (that can take 1 turn acutally)
    -also blocks falling to block lasers (maybe also have this take 1 turn)
    -but in general lasers mke things complicated
-add level selector and some way to organize levels
-add ability to save solutions next to levels
-add 3d rotation support to leel editor
-blocks 
    -3d mirrors
    -tubes (for laser splitting)
    -add directional laser goal
    -destructible blocks that can't be moved
    -destructible blocks that can be moved
    -combined movable blocks 
    -glass block, laser passes through but not ppl


:: 8/24/2026 visual language

lets switch gears for a moment and work on styling. we want a layered styling sorta thing. each block has the
  following, base model, color, texture over color, transparency. We will use these 3 properties to build a visual
  language for the blocks. Note that models may not just be hardcoded geometric shapse but we will import stuff with
  textures in the future. Don't worry too harda bout that now, basically in these cases, the texture/color will onyl
  apply to parts of the model, but for hardcode geometric shapes, it will apply to everything.. anyways, build out
  this visual language for block styling. we will layer on top of it. also can you propose anything else we can add
  to this language? I want felxibility for introducing new block types


-combined blocks ideally have their own custom representation... for now, just apply some cute texture on all blocks that are combined
-new block creation factory (not important right now)
    -to facilitate combined block graphics, we need a block creation funciton that generates a custom model for combined blocks.
    -the general factory has a couple of shapes it supports
        -block
        -mirror
        -pyramid
    -each shape has faces that coincide with the block walls, the faces shap may either be at triangle (2 edges) or a square (4 edges)
    -coincididing faces get theri edges combined to create a unified volume
    -if the combined jobect is meovable. round over the actual edges of the combined model



  
